  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "engine",
      "label": "main.py · 录制引擎",
      "kind": "business",
      "subtitle": "读房间清单 → 开播检测 → 组装 ffmpeg 命令 → 停止收尾",
      "groupId": "engine-proc",
      "module": "record-engine",
      "facts": [
        "4480 行单文件编排层：start_record() 是录制命令的构造入口",
        "safe_exit() 接信号做优雅停止，收尾时归档运行日志",
        "get_status() 暴露引擎内存状态快照，供 Web API 直接读取",
        "停止录制流程经 src.log_archive.archive_runtime_logs() 按时间戳改名四份日志"
      ],
      "source": {
        "kind": "source",
        "file": "main.py",
        "lineStart": 3063,
        "lineEnd": 3120,
        "symbol": "start_record"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 1189,
        "y": 1175
      },
      "size": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 139
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "shell-web",
      "label": "web.py · Web 面板入口",
      "kind": "service",
      "subtitle": "守护线程跑 main.main()，主线程跑 uvicorn",
      "groupId": "engine-proc",
      "module": "web-console",
      "facts": [
        "与 CLI 共用同一进程，所以接口能读引擎内存状态、无需 IPC",
        "在 uvicorn 构造之前重绑 loguru 控制台 sink，避免日志丢失",
        "端口/密码/鉴权开关取自 Web 配置默认值"
      ],
      "source": {
        "kind": "source",
        "file": "web.py",
        "lineStart": 172,
