    {
      "id": "shell-gui",
      "label": "gui.py · 桌面控制台",
      "kind": "service",
      "subtitle": "以子进程方式拉起 main.py 并托管其生命周期",
      "module": "console-gui",
      "facts": [
        "独立进程：从不 import main，避免与子进程重复初始化引擎",
        "冻结打包下 sys.executable 指向 GUI exe，需换启动目标否则递归拉起自身",
        "停止走 CTRL_BREAK_EVENT 让 main.py 自清 ffmpeg 孙进程，taskkill /T 作硬杀兜底"
      ],
      "source": {
        "kind": "source",
        "file": "gui.py",
        "lineStart": 2274,
        "lineEnd": 2300
      },
      "position": {
