    {
      "id": "ffmpeg-exec",
      "label": "src/ffmpeg_proc.py · 进程托管",
      "kind": "component",
      "subtitle": "ffmpeg 子进程注册、终止与全局清理",
      "groupId": "engine-proc",
      "module": "recording-exec",
      "facts": [
        "main.py 直接 Popen ffmpeg，句柄注册进本模块统一持有",
        "cleanup_all_ffmpeg_processes() 在退出收尾调用，避免孤儿进程",
        "录后处理 src/video_postprocess.py 复用同一二进制做分段/转 mp4·m4a/生成字幕"
      ],
      "source": {
