    {
      "id": "danmaku",
      "label": "DanmakuCollector · 弹幕管线",
      "kind": "business",
      "subtitle": "弹幕采集 → 半小时分片 SRT → 监控事件汇总",
      "groupId": "engine-proc",
      "module": "danmaku",
      "facts": [
        "src/__init__.py 的 get_danmaku_collector() 按平台名惰性构造，注册表延迟到调用期",
        "平台类在 src/platforms/*（斗鱼/B站/虎牙/抖音/Twitch），共用 src/ws_client.WsClient",
        "src/srt_writer.py 按分片写 SRT，时间轴与录像对齐",
        "src/danmaku_monitor.DanmakuMonitorHub 以 JSONL 汇总事件供 Web/GUI 消费"
      ],
      "source": {
